			"notes": "# Hello All!\n\n## Initial Release just in time for Diamondfire's 1.21.1 update. With Recode no longer being supported, I have now taken it upon myself to maintain the noteblock community within Diamondfire.\n\n### Recreated the `/nbs load` command to allow people to continue to import songs. The player has not been added yet.\n\n### `/nbs load_custom` is the same as normal load, but pitch values are not adjusted to fit the Minecraft pitch values. I have more coming for this inn the future, just ignore it for now.\n\n### `/nbs gui` will become a more user-friendly menu for finding and picking songs. Isn't finished as I pushed this update for people to use within the next 6 hours.\n\n### Readme created but not made nice looking. contains discord link I will use for all my development things. It is empty so feel free to join and suggest things."
